Attribution and modification notice
-----------------------------------

Puzzlestack is a modified derivative of "Puzzle" by Sidhant Khatkar
<https://github.com/sidhant947/Puzzle>, distributed under GPL-3.0.

This is a modified version. Changes made by the Puzzlestack authors include, but
are not limited to:

  2026-06  Added a full-screen vertical "Shuffle" feed and a discovery-oriented
           home screen (Daily Pick, Quick Play, recents, category rooms) in
           place of the original flat game list.

  2026-08  Rebranded the fork: new application name and identifiers, new icon
           and colour system, and rewritten user-facing copy and store listing.

  2026-11  Named Puzzlestack: application name and identifiers set to
